  (descr "EVALUATION ONLY: CH005-2032LF rear mounted, two-lead side pad 1 positive and single lead pad 2 negative are an unverified hypothesis from https://unagidojyou.com/2026/06-01/advantest_dmm_change_cmos_battery/ . Before PCB manufacture verify view handedness and continuity of both positive leads and negative contact using the exact holder and a cell. BODY/COURTYARD APPROXIMATE: 22x16.1 center + 28.5x7 end tabs + dia20 cell, with 0.25 mm courtyard; check against actual part. Body 28.5 x 16.1 mm, CR2032 dia 20 mm, height 5.4 mm; leads project 3.5 mm. Manufacturer PCB view direction not stated. https://akizukidenshi.com/goodsaffix/CH005-2032LF.pdf")
